BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall In for Nancy in Baltimore
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T160000
UID:3b3f0c5ce9c252dce668bef2f6fecdaf@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/PhotOle_1471_20260806210745923510.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join friends\, neighbors\, nurses\, and healthcare professiona
 ls to meet Nancy Mannion\, DNP\, RN\, as she campaigns to represent Pennsy
 lvania's 11th Congressional District\, just across the Maryland border. Na
 ncy's career as a nurse and healthcare leader reflects the qualities we ne
 ed more of in elected office: integrity\, trust\, strong communication\, e
 vidence-based decision-making\, and the ability to lead calmly through com
 plex challenges. Come meet Nancy\, hear about her vision for the district\
 , share
LOCATION:Baltimore\, MD
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/citizensfornancymannion/event/1004117/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Southern End Poll Greeting Interest Form
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T040000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261103T170000
UID:5f876f3a8b300b141aa9d7e26b210d5e@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Untitled%20%2820%29_20260406201551781393.png
DESCRIPTION:Poll Greeters are needed at all of The Southern End's polling 
 places throughout the day on Election Day! Poll Greeters hand out sample b
 allots and candidate literature\, answer voter questions\, and are a frien
 dly face for local Democrats coming to vote. We need volunteers to take sh
 ifts to set up and break down the greeter tables\, and volunteers to meet 
 the public in two-hour shifts while the polls are open. ✳ Election Dates
 : * 2026 Primary Election: Tuesday\, May 19\, 2026 * 2026 General Election
 :
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/934239/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Columbia Democratic Committee Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261012T163000
UID:f9ac01877879a2653c15f8a23ca71927@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mobilize_CDC_20240516182011240934_20260105171820176157.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Columbia Democratic Committee meets on the second Monday o
 f each month at 6:30 pm to discuss upcoming elections\, meet local candida
 tes for office\, plan volunteer actions and get-out-the-vote events\, and 
 more. This is a public meeting open to all local Democrats! Meetings take 
 place in the Columbia Library Community Room. As you enter the library\, g
 o to the left past the front desk and turn right to go down to the basemen
 t. You can also support our efforts by making a donation!
LOCATION:Columbia Public Library\, 24 S 6th St 1599\, Columbia\, PA\, 1751
 2
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/lancastercountydems/event/898958/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
