UID:f6aa1d76d77538bc4741faba7eb17497@mobilize.us
DESCRIPTION:Join us in canvassing to help Jess Branas (State House\, Distr
 ict 97) and Nancy Mannion (U.S. House\, PA-11) win the election. We’ll b
 e talking directly with voters to make sure they know what’s at stake in
  this election and why Jess Branas & Nancy Mannion are the right choices t
 o move our community forward. Every conversation helps turn out critical s
 upport needed to get through the primary and onto the general election bal
 lot. No experience needed\, we’ll start with a quick training and provid
 e s
